<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>404 – Page Not Found | RailEase</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0,0" rel="stylesheet"/>
</head>
<body style="background:var(--surface); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; flex-direction:column; text-align:center; padding:2rem;">
  <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:5rem; color:var(--outline); margin-bottom:1.5rem; display:block;">train_off</span>
  <h1 class="font-headline" style="font-size:5rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--primary); margin-bottom:0.5rem;">404</h1>
  <h2 class="font-headline" style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:400; color:var(--on-surface); margin-bottom:1rem;">Page Not Found</h2>
  <p style="color:var(--on-surface-variant); font-size:0.95rem; max-width:400px; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:2rem;">
    The route you're looking for doesn't exist on our railway network. Please check the address or return to the dashboard.
  </p>
  <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-primary" style="text-decoration:none; font-size:0.9rem;">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">home</span> Back to Dashboard
  </a>
</body>
</html>
